                            <comment id="14662804" author="githubbot" created="Sat, 8 Aug 2015 04:35:37 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user Leemoonsoo commented on the pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/181#issuecomment-128912228&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/incubator-zeppelin/pull/181#issuecomment-128912228&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

